{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>DumbLevel 是一款為掛畫、安裝層架而設的 iPhone 水平儀應用，適合自行佈置家居、需要精準對位的用家。程式讀數精確至 0.1 度，並內置掛畫規劃器，直接計算並列出標記位置。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-62.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>多軸水平儀結合掛畫計算</h2>\n<p>DumbLevel 按手機擺放方向自動切換水平、垂直與雙軸氣泡模式，讀數精確至 0.1 度，並以顏色及文字指出哪一端偏高。長按可凍結讀數，提示音隨接近水平而加快。內置校正以兩次反向量度抵銷感應器偏差。掛畫規劃器按相框、層架、窗簾桿等項目計算位置，直接列出離牆邊的吋數標記，並可輸出 PDF 或翻查過往工程紀錄。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-308-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-309-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-310-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-311-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-312-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-313-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：DumbLevel</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/dumblevel/id6814969127?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:20.971560+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:36:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:38.590295+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:46.922417+00:00","content_hash":"26bfaaacc126506a198ce0f72c94bec559cf90111a19618ea97996f828f5a3a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}